@5034 = ~Coral's Pearl~

@5035 = ~A lustrous pearl taken from a sirine. It seems unusually important to its rightful owner.~

@5036 = ~A luminous pearl, prized by sirines as a symbol of their essence. Coral believes its loss has robbed her of the freedom to move through the sea as she once did.~

@5037 = ~Cloak of Vestiges~

@5038 = ~An old elven cloak, infused with unusually persistent magical warmth.~

@5039 = ~Cloak of Vestiges

Woven from rare elven cloth and suffused with protective magic, this cloak is attributed to a mage of Suldanessellar who struggled with the bitterest winters. Lacking the resilience to harsh climates that many of his kin enjoyed, he devised a garment that would shelter him from the cold and steadily mend the weariness of his journeys.

STATISTICS:
Cold Resistance: +50%
Regeneration: 2 Hit Points per round~

