@5049 = ~Helmet of Opposite Alignment~

@5050 = ~Helmet of Opposite Alignment

This peculiar helm reverses the moral and ethical alignment of whoever wears it. Good becomes evil and evil good; law becomes chaos and chaos law. A neutral outlook remains neutral along its respective axis. It also protects its wearer from critical hits.

Unlike other specimens of this enchantment, this helm bears no binding curse and may be removed freely. Its strange magic persists only while it is worn.

Portalbendarwinden offered it with an unsettling observation: a choice has meaning only when one is free to undo it.~

