@5055 = ~Potion of Life Saving~

@5056 = ~When consumed, the potion restores 80 HP of the person. This is the most powerful variant of the healing potion. The effect is instantaneous, and the potion is destroyed in the process.

STATISTICS:

Special: Restores 80 Hit Points

Weight: 1~

